            "value" : "TurnOver не удалось запустить"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TurnOver counts the characters as you type; Tab moves on" : {
      "comment" : "Said once on reaching a password field",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TurnOver siz yazdıkça karakterleri sayar; Tab ilerler"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TurnOver считает символы по мере набора; Tab идёт дальше"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TurnOver doesn't read %@ yet. Read it with TurnOver from now on, for %@?" : {
      "comment" : "A plugin's app TurnOver doesn't read: the app, then the plugin",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "TurnOver doesn't read %1$@ yet. Read it with TurnOver from now on, for %2$@?"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TurnOver henüz %1$@ uygulamasını okumuyor. %2$@ için bundan sonra TurnOver ile okunsun mu?"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TurnOver пока не читает %@. Читать это с TurnOver с этого момента, для %@?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TurnOver doesn't read %@ yet. Read them with TurnOver from now on, for %@?" : {
      "comment" : "A plugin's apps TurnOver doesn't read: the apps, then the plugins",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
